{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>For right and left you shall burst forth.</b> Like כי תרבי, and similarly ופרצת ימה (Isaiah 28:14). Some commentators derive it from the root פרץ." "<b>And your seed shall possess nations.</b> The meaning of כי ימין ושמאל תפרוצי." "<b>They shall settle.</b> Your seed."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 54, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:27.523498111Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}